PASSProcessModelElement
- hasAdditionalAttribute min 0 AdditionalAttribute
- hasModelComponentID max 1 string
- hasModelComponentLabel min 0 string

    PASSProcessModel
    - hasAdditionalAttribute min 1 AdditionalAttribute
    - hasRelationToModelComponent min 1 MessageExchange
    - hasRelationToModelComponent min 1 Subject
    - hasStartSubject min 1 StartSubject
    > implements only PASSProcesModel

        LayeredPASSProcessModel : ALPSModelElement

    InteractionDescribingComponent

        Subject : SimplePASSElement
        - hasIncomingMessageExchange min 1 MessageExchange
        - hasMaximumSubjectInstanceRestriction max 1 int
        - hasOutgoingMessageExchange min 1 MessageExchange
        - hasSubjectExecutionMapping min 0 SubjectExecutionMapping
        > implements only Subject

            FullySpecifiedSubject
            - containsBaseBehavior exactly 1 SubjectBehavior
            - containsBehavior min 1 SubjectBehavior
            - hasDataDefinition max 1 SubjectDataDefinition
            - hasInputPoolConstraint min 1 InputPoolConstraint

            InterfaceSubject
            - containsBehavior max 0 SubjectBehavior
            > references max 1 FullySpecifiedSubject

            MultiSubject
            - hasMaximumSubjectInstanceRestriction exactly 1 int(>=2)
                AbstractMultiSubject : AbstractSubject
            SingleSubject
            - hasMaximumSubjectInstanceRestriction value 1 
                AbstractSingleSubject : AbstractSubject

            StartSubject

            AbstractSubject : ALPSSIDComponent

            StandAloneMacroSubject : ALPSSIDComponent
            > contains exactly 1 MacroBehavior

            SubjectExtension : ALPSSIDComponent
            > extends exactly 1 Subject
            > contains only ExtensionBehavior

                GuardExtension
                MacroExtension

            SubjectGroup : ALPSSIDComponent
            > contains only Subject

                SystemInterfaceSubject : InterfaceSubject
                > contains only InterfaceSubject

        SubjectExecutionMapping
        - hasExecutionMappingDefinition exactly 1 string

            DynamicSubjectExecutionMapping
            StaticSubjectExecutionMapping

        MessageExchangeList : SimplePASSElement
        > contains min 1 MessageExchange

        MessageExchange : SimplePASSElement
        - hasMessageType exactly 1 MessageSpecification
        - hasReceiver max 1 Subject
        - hasSender max 1 Subject

            AbstractMessageExchange : ALPSSIDComponent
            FinalizedMessageExchange : ALPSSIDComponent

        MessageSpecification : SimplePASSElement
        - containsPayloadDescription max 1 PayloadDescription

        InputPoolConstraint
        - hasHandlingStrategy exactly 1 InputPoolConstraintHandlingStrategy
        - hasLimit exactly 1 int(>=0)

            MessageSenderTypeConstraint
            > references exactly 1 MessageSpecification
            > references exactly 1 Subject
            MessageTypeConstraint
            > references exactly 1 MessageSpecification
            SenderTypeConstraint
            > references exactly 1 Subject

        InputPoolConstraintHandlingStrategy
        +Instance InputPoolConstraintStrategy-Blocking
        +Instance InputPoolConstraintStrategy-DeleteLatest
        +Instance InputPoolConstraintStrategy-DeleteOldest
        +Instance InputPoolConstraintStrategy-Drop

        ALPSSIDComponent : ALPSModelElement

            ActorPlaceHolder

            CommunicationChannel
            - hasCorrespondent exactly 2 Subject

                BiDirectionalCommunicationChannel
                UniDirectionalCommunicationChannel
                - hasReceiver max 1 Subject
                - hasSender max 1 Subject
            
            CommunicationRestriction
            - hasCorrespondent exactly 2 Subject

    SubjectBehavior
    - hasInitialState exactly 1 InitialStateOfBehavior
    - hasPriorityNumber exactly 1 int(>=0)
    > contains only BehaviorDescribingComponent
    > implements min 1 SubjectBehavior
    
        GuardBehavior
        - guardsBehavior min 1 SubjectBehavior
        - guardsState min 1 State

        MacroBehavior
        > contains min 1 GenericReturnToOriginReference
        > contains min 1 StateReference
        > contains max 0 EndState

        SubjectBaseBehavior : SimplePASSElement
        - hasEndState min 1 EndState
        > contains max 0 StateReference

        ExtensionBehavior : ALPSModelElement

    BehaviorDescribingComponent
    - belongsTo exactly 1 SubjectBehavior

        State:
        - belongsTo exactly 1 Action
        - guardedBy min 1 GuardBehavior
        - hasFunctionSpecification max 1 FunctionSpecification
        - hasIncomingTransition min 0 Transition
        - hasOutgoingTransition min 0 Transition
        > implements only State

            ChoiceSegment
            > contains min 2 ChoiceSegmentPath

            ChoiceSegmentPath
            - belongsTo exactly 1 ChoiceSegment
            - hasEndState exactly 1 State
            - hasInitialState exactly 1 InitialStateOfChoiceSegmentPath
            - isOptionalToEndChoiceSegmentPath max 1 bool
            - isOptionalToStartChoiceSegmentPath max 1 bool
            > contains min 1 State

                MandatoryToEndChoiceSegmentPath
                - isOptionalToStartChoiceSegmentPath value true 
                MandatoryToStartChoiceSegmentPath
                - isOptionalToEndChoiceSegmentPath value true 
                OptionalToEndChoiceSegmentPath
                - isOptionalToStartChoiceSegmentPath value false 
                OptionalToStartChoiceSegmentPath
                - isOptionalToEndChoiceSegmentPath value false 

            InitialStateOfChoiceSegmentPath
            - belongsTo exactly 1 ChoiceSegmentPath

            MacroState
            - referencesMacroBehavior exactly 1 MacroBehavior
            > contains min 1 StateReference
                
            StateReference
            > references exactly 1 State

            GenericReturnToOriginReference

            EndState : SimplePASSElement
            InitialStateOfBehavior : SimplePASSElement
            StandardPASSState : SimplePASSElement

                DoState
                - hasDataMappingFunction min 1 DataMappingIncomingToLocal
                - hasDataMappingFunction min 1 DataMappingLocalToOutgoing
                - hasFunctionSpecification only DoFunction
                - hasOutgoingTransition max 0 ReceiveTransition
                - hasOutgoingTransition max 0 SendTransition

                ReceiveState
                - hasFunctionSpecification only ReceiveFunction
                - hasOutgoingTransition min 1 Transition
                - hasOutgoingTransition max 0 DoTransition
                - hasOutgoingTransition max 0 SendTransition

                SendState
                - hasFunctionSpecification only SendFunction
                - hasOutgoingTransition max 1 SendTransition
                - hasOutgoingTransition min 0 SendingFailedTransition
                - hasOutgoingTransition min 1 Transition
                - hasOutgoingTransition max 0 DoTransition
                - hasOutgoingTransition max 0 ReceiveTransition
            
            AbstractState : ALPSSBDComponent
                AbstractDoState : DoState
                AbstractReceiveState : ReceiveState
                AbstractSendState : SendState
                GeneralAbstractState
            FinalizedState : ALPSSBDComponent
            GroupState : ALPSSBDComponent
            StatePlaceHolder : ALPSSBDComponent

        Action
        > contains exactly 1 State
        > contains min 1 Transition

        FunctionSpecification : SimplePASSElement
        - hasToolSpecificDefinition exactly 1 string

            CommunicationAct
                ReceiveFunction
                +Instance DefaultFunctionReceive1_EnvironmentChoice
                +Instance DefaultFunctionReceive2_AutoReceiveEarliest
                SendFunction
                +Instance DefaultFunctionSend
            DoFunction
            +Instance DefaultFunctionDo1_EnvironmentChoice
            +Instance DefaultFunctionDo2_AutomaticEvaluation

        Transition
        - belongsTo max 1 Action
        - hasSourceState only State
        - hasTargetState only State
        - hasTransitionCondition exactly 1 TransitionCondition
        > implements only Transition

            CommunicationTransition : SimplePASSElement
            - hasTransitionCondition exactly 1 MessageExchangeCondition

                ReceiveTransition
                - hasDataMappingFunction min 1 DataMappingIncomingToLocal
                - hasPriorityNumber max 1 int(>=0)
                - hasTransitionCondition exactly 1 ReceiveTransitionCondition

                SendTransition
                - hasDataMappingFunction min 1 DataMappingLocalToOutgoing
                - hasTransitionCondition exactly 1 SendTransitionCondition

            DoTransition : SimplePASSElement
            - hasPriorityNumber max 1 int(>=0)

            SendingFailedTransition
            - hasSourceState only SendState
            - hasTransitionCondition exactly 1 SendingFailedCondition

            TimeTransition

                ReminderTransition
                - hasSourceState max 0 SendState

                    CalendarBasedReminderTransition
                    TimeBasedReminderTransition

                TimerTransition

                    BusinessDayTimerTransition
                    DayTimeTimerTransition
                    YearMonthTimerTransition

            UserCancelTransition

            AbstractPASSTransition : ALPSSBDComponent
                AdviceTransitionType
                    AdviceDoTransition : DoTransition
                    AdviceReceiveTransition : ReceiveTransition
                    AdviceSendTransition : SendTransition
                FinalizedTransitionType
                    FinalizedDoTransition : DoTransition
                    FinalizedReceiveTransition : ReceiveTransition
                    FinalizedSendTransition : SendTransition
                FlowRestrictor
                PrecedenceTransitionType
                    PrecedenceDoTransition : DoTransition
                    PrecedenceReceiveTransition : ReceiveTransition
                    PrecedenceSendTransition : SendTransition
                TriggerTransitionType
                    TriggerDoTransition : DoTransition
                    TriggerReceiveTransition : ReceiveTransition
                    TriggerSendTransition : SendTransition

        TransitionCondition
        - hasToolSpecificDefinition max 1 string

            DoTransitionCondition : SimplePASSElement

            MessageExchangeCondition : SimplePASSElement
            - requiresPerformedMessageExchange exactly 1 MessageExchange

                ReceiveTransitionCondition
                - hasMultiReceiveLowerBound max 1 int(>0)
                - hasMultiReceiveUpperBound max 1 int(>0)
                - hasReceiveType max 1 ReceiveType
                - requiresMessageSentFrom max 1 Subject
                - requiresReceptionOfMessage max 1 MessageSpecification

                SendTransitionCondition
                - hasMultiSendLowerBound max 1 int(>0)
                - hasMultiSendUpperBound max 1 int(>0)
                - hasSendType max 1 SendType
                - requiresMessageSentTo max 1 Subject
                - requiresSendingOfMessage max 1 MessageSpecification

            SendingFailedCondition

            TimeTransitionCondition
            - hasTimeValue exactly 1 string

                ReminderEventTransitionCondition

                    CalendarBasedReminderTransitionCondition
                    TimeBasedReminderTransitionCondition

                TimerTransitionCondition

                    BusinessDayTimerTransitionCondition
                    DayTimeTimerTransitionCondition
                    - hasTimeValue exactly 1 dateTime
                    YearMonthTimerTransitionCondition
                    - hasTimeValue exactly 1 yearMonthDuration

        ReceiveType
        +Instance ReceiveTypeMultiReceiveFromAllKnown
        +Instance ReceiveTypeMultiReceiveFromKnwon
        +Instance ReceiveTypeStandard

        SendType
        +Instance SendTypeMultiSendToAll
        +Instance SendTypeMultiSendToKnown
        +Instance SendTypeMultiSendToNew
        +Instance SendTypeStandard

        ALPSSBDComponent : ALPSModelElement
    
    DataDescribingComponent
    
        DataMappingFunction : SimplePASSElement
        - hasFeelExpressionAsDataMapping OR hasToolSpecificDefinition exactly 1 string
        - hasDataMappingString exactly 1 string

            DataMappingIncomingToLocal
            DataMappingLocalToOutgoing
        
        DataObjectDefinition
        - hasDataType exactly 1 DataTypeDefinition

            DataObjectListDefinition
            SubjectDataDefinition
            PayloadDataObjectDefinition : PayloadDescription, SimplePASSElement ###
        
        DataTypeDefinition
        > contains min 1 DataObjectDefinition

            CustomOrExternalDataTypeDefinition

                JSONDataTypeDefinition
                OWLDataTypeDefinition
                XSD-DataTypeDefinition
            
            ModelBuiltInDataTypes : SimplePASSElement
        
        PayloadDescription

            PayloadPhysicalObjectDescrption
            PayloadDataObjectDefinition : DataObjectDefinition, SimplePASSElement ###

    ALPSModelElement

        ModelLayer
            - hasPriorityNumber exactly 1 int(>0)
            > implements only ModelLayer
            > extends max 1 ModelLayer
            > contains min 1 InteractionDescribingComponent
            
                AbstractLayer
                > contains min 1 ALPSModelElement
                BaseLayer
                > contains max 0 ALPSModelElement
                ExtensionLayer
                > contains min 1 SubjectExtension
                GuardLayer
                - guardsLayer min 1 ModelLayer
                > contains min 1 GuardExtension
                MacroLayer
                > contains min 1 MacroExtension